  "version": 1,
  "about": "Mothers' circle content check, layer 1 (rules). One file used by the server (supabase/functions/community) and the app (assets/content/community_rules.json, a byte-for-byte copy checked by test/community_test.dart). A term matches at the start of a word, so 'stop' also matches 'stopped'. A rule matches when every group in 'all' has a term in the same sentence and no 'unless' term is there.",
